      "summary": "Confirm manifest gap intent vs dev baseline: (1) guard.infra.terraform_state and guard.firewall.open_world omitted \u2014 project has no Terraform and ports are bound by Docker not app code, so these guards are not applicable. (2) allowed_tools.web.blocked_url_patterns omitted \u2014 project uses Ollama exclusively, not OpenAI; no direct OpenAI call risk from skill code. (3) project_rules.commit_convention omitted \u2014 conventional commits are followed by convention, not enforced via manifest pre-commit hook in this branch. (4) pool-fitter, auth-warden, block-smith, survivor-smith added to approved_skills \u2014 these are registered gap-closure skills in the org skill registry."
